		"description": "Aviation Jet Fuel JET A-1 (JETA1) is a clear liquid hydrocarbon-based mixture designed primarily for use as a turbine engine fuel in industrial and professional aviation applications. This complex fuel has a boiling range of 130–300°C, a flash point of greater than equals to 38°C, and a freezing point of greater than equals to -47°C. It is inherently hydrophobic with very poor water solubility and evaporates slowly.",
